#]]
 ]

 [; Absolute ('/'-rooted) PathExpr per grammar [130] `'/' StepList` (#391):
    anchored at the DOCUMENT node, so the head step's child axis holds
    exactly the root element. Previously the program parser rejected the
    form outright ("unexpected token '/' in expression position") while
    the same bytes parsed in a data reading — the #391 mode-flip repro 3. ]

