 [; Implicit $doc selection in a one-source homoiconic program (code.md
    §1.3): $doc binds to the first DATA root — the first top-level element
    literal in source order — never to a program-directive root's status
    value, wherever the directive sits (#435: a leading [?lib]/[?def]
    captured $doc as [result status=ok …] and every document query silently
    matched nothing). ]

