 [# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
    GENERATOR FAMILY RESHAPE (Stage B — gate=advisory RED frontier).
    Prefix [$range]/[$iterate]/[$unfold]; infix to/by retired. Each case flips
    to enforced as its C-gen-N phase lands. Single oracle: render_canonical.
    P2-21 range · P2-22 iterate/unfold · P2-31 NO-INFIX-RANGE · N-GEN-3 kind.
    ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ #]

 [# ── P2-21 [$range] as a value in every expression position (C-gen-1) ── #]
