 # ── Single-match node-set queries keep sequence shape (code.md §6.2) ──
 # A node-set query (descendant / wildcard / predicate / parent axis) over
 # a binding yields a SEQUENCE regardless of cardinality. A single match
 # must not collapse to the bare element — [$count] would then count the
 # element's items (container arity) instead of the one match.

