    expected-red frontier (RUNS, REPORTED, NON-BLOCKING; flips enforced when its
    impl lands). gate unset/enforced = grounded behaviour true today (incl.
    grounded negatives). Single oracle: vcx/target/cx render_canonical.
    ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ #]

